v.2.0.0
=======
- Align authentication with hope-api-auth 0.3
- Refactor deduplication set states to a granular lifecycle with validated transitions, group-level processing lock and restructured API endpoints
- Add per-group deduplication settings with a dedicated API endpoint and admin form
- Move findings and approve endpoints to the deduplication set level
- Remove ignored pairs functionality
- Remove the status field from Encoding; add Rejected status to the deduplication set
- Remove the face confidence threshold
- Rename AZURE_CLIENT_KEY to AZURE_CLIENT_ID
- Add OFIQ image quality check with configurable thresholds and reuse of precalculated OFIQ scores
- Store uploaded images on a mounted disk instead of DB base64
- Add graceful cancellation and live progress tracking to the deduplication task
- Add config snapshot to findings and expose it via admin and API
- Add audit log to the deduplication set
- Add group status endpoint and a separate endpoint to mark a deduplication set as ready; process endpoint supports encode_only
- Format JSON fields in the admin for readability
- Optimize admin changelist queries and fix slow loading of Findings and Encodings pages
- Add logging and retries to the notification
- Add missing HTTP security headers (CSP, HSTS, Referrer-Policy, X-Content-Type-Options, X-Frame-Options)
- Harden session cookie handling and raise HSTS max-age default to one year
- Fix incorrect chunk size calculation when creating findings
- Fix inclusion of approved sets in findings
- Fix file permission issue with Azure file storage
- Fix config change API endpoint behavior
- Return 409 instead of 500 when a deduplication set cannot be created
- Prevent a single failing image from aborting the face encoding job

v.1.15.0
========
- Simplify the deduplication flow; remove chords from encoding and deduplication
- Use iterator to reduce memory usage
- Handle DataTypeError when encoding faces
- Improve embedding clearance
- Add visibility_timeout config and remove time limits
- Change the argument order for find_distance

v.1.14.0
========
- Handle base64 data URLs in images
- Force one active deduplication set per group and return 404 when there is no active set
- Add a send notification button in the admin
- Improve admin display of base64 filenames

v.1.13.0
========
- Update finding on duplicate values
- Make deduplication set settings optional
- Session cookie alignment
- Fix port and roll back entrypoint changes

v.1.12
======
- Use django-celery-boost for all tasks
- Admin enhancements: breadcrumbs, confirm_action on data-changing buttons, custom button permissions, DedupJob and Job admin pages
- Add export of findings as CSV
- Add status_code field to Findings with filtering and search
- Store and display face coverage values for encodings
- Add HOPE_API_TOKEN configuration and mask secret values
- Add SUPERUSERS support to the update command
- Use Dedup Engine specific queues
- Update GitHub Actions

v.1.11.2
========
- Fix build tag and release Docker build/dependency lock (build-only release)

v.1.11.1
========
- Add face coverage threshold to the DeepFace encoding pipeline
- Add possibility to test face detection
- Admin button and action updates

v.1.11
======
- Add possibility to run deduplication synchronously
- Merge Image and Encoding models; Finding now uses Encoding foreign keys
- Add admin preview page for Finding images and search by reference
- Add reset encodings and remove findings buttons
- Add help texts to deduplication set and group fields
- Configure models and thresholds via constance
- Use the deduplication set group reference pk to identify a deduplication set

v.1.10
======
- Optimize the duplicate finding process: compare images between chunks, tune chunk size, sort findings before insertion
- Compute embeddings only when missing, recreate them on system errors, and do not skip images already in findings
- Add indexes to the Finding model and change the DedupJob relation to a ForeignKey on DeduplicationSet
- Reschedule find_duplicates to avoid parallel runs
- Filter findings by updated_at and by reference keys; add pagination for findings
- Make image create endpoints idempotent
- Rename DateInRangeFilter to DateInDateRangeFilter
- Upgrade Django to 5.2.8 and tune uwsgi buffers

v.1.9.0
=======
- Use a database connection pool; check and shrink connections after the deduplication task
- Do not use signals for progress reporting
- Mark result backend thread-safe and increase pool size and timeout
- Add more statuses to the deduplication set
- Increase test coverage

